# P0-06 service skeleton renames (docs/jellyfin/05-plan.md P0-06, 04 §2). `Old New`, whole words.
#
# Deferred on purpose:
#   PlexServiceError -> stays: its NSError domain "Dusk.PlexServiceError" is sent
#                       in analytics error reports (see 01_types.table).
#   PlexTransportSecurity -> CredentialTransportPolicy is a new Core protocol;
#                       the Plex type keeps its name and moves to Providers/Plex.

PlexService                 MediaService
plexService                 media
PlexServerConnection        ServerSession
_plexService                _media
